//File:    test_params_full.jtext
//Date:    2026-10-30
//Purpose: Full-intensity matrix selection and settings for `jac313_test_cli matrix` (v001), picked with
//         --params <file>.
//
// Full-intensity matrix run (per-test scaling from get_matrix_scaling).
//
// selection: one row per package or test to include (include false leaves it out):
//   qlite, jtext, store   a package: every ctest smoke/unit in it
//   001 ... 008, flags, metric_view   a matrix stress test (ported ts_store 001-008 TS/XS + flags)
//   any other name        one ctest test, named without its path
//                         (e.g. jac313_store_binary_persist_smoke)
// settings: one row per key.
//   DISK_TYPE  auto | xssd rssd xx7k xr7k x10k r10k x15k r15k  (results layout label; x = one
//              disk, r = RAID; a machine sets its own in ~/.config/jac313/disk_type or
//              JAC313_DISK_TYPE)
//   SIZE       smoke | full | bench  (smoke = default; full uses per-test scaling via
//              test_params_full.jtext; bench is test_params_bench.jtext)
//   OS_ID      optional (e.g. OS_001) for test-results/OS_001/... layout
// production: one row, the bench's production run (store_bench --production; see docs/Benchmarks.md).
//   keeper_sink    jtext | html | json         the keeper file: only events flagged KeeperRecord
//   database_sink  sql | pg-local | pg-remote  the database: only events flagged DatabaseEntry
//   keeper_pct     0..100  % of events flagged KeeperRecord
//   database_pct   0..100  % of events flagged DatabaseEntry
//   binary         true = also write the binary replay log (every event)
//   Jac313Runner shows and saves this row (Persist to box); jac313_test_cli --bench passes it on.
//
